msgid "勾选后，关键字里的 * 和 ? 按通配符匹配：\n    *  匹配任意多个字符（可以是零个）\n    ?  匹配恰好一个字符\n示例：\n    会议*纪要    找到「会议纪要」「会议第二次纪要」\n    张?    找到「张三」「张伟」\n    202?年    找到「2025年」「2026年」\n    报告*.pdf    找到名字里有「报告」且后面有「.pdf」的文件\n仍按「包含」查找，不区分英文大小写；不勾选时 * 和 ? 按普通字符查找。"
msgstr "When checked, * and ? in the keyword work as wildcards:\n    *  matches any number of characters (including none)\n    ?  matches exactly one character\nExamples:\n    meeting*notes    finds \"meeting notes\", \"meeting 2 notes\"\n    J?n    finds \"Jan\", \"Jon\"\n    202?    finds \"2025\", \"2026\"\n    report*.pdf    finds files whose names contain \"report\" followed by \".pdf\"\nResults still only need to contain the keyword, and letter case is ignored. When unchecked, * and ? are searched as ordinary characters."

